sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Facilitator
  participant W as Vibuco server
  participant C as Cognito
  participant D as PostgreSQL

  U->>W: Open protected workspace
  W-->>U: Redirect with state, nonce, PKCE
  U->>C: Authenticate
  C-->>W: Authorization code
  W->>C: Exchange code + verifier
  C-->>W: Validated OIDC tokens
  W->>D: Resolve account + entitlement
  D-->>W: Active access
  W-->>U: Secure session cookie + workspace
